# Worker: Privacy & PII Gate

## Goal (Master-aligned)

Enable safer Intake → Compare → Report drafting via Category 3/4 **detect → warn → redact** before persist and before LLM. Assistive only — never claim perfect detection or legal compliance.

## Role boundary

**Own:** `pii_gate.py`, privacy router, `PrivacyGate.tsx`, warn/redact contracts.  
**Do not own:** case store, IR allegation/quotes, LLM prompts, auth/roles, intake stepper chrome (beyond gate UI).

## Invariants

- Assistive safety layer — no compliance certification language
- Redact before persist and before LLM when gated
- Evidence uploads may be unscanned; do not pretend otherwise
- False positives must have a clear continue/redact path (no IR dead end)

## Anti-goals

- Hard-block drafting with no recovery
- Logging raw Cat 3/4 beyond deliberate audit/support design
- Expanding into Identity Admin or IR quote authority
- Treating the gate as sole-source or statute-related

## Success criteria

- Warn → acknowledge/redact contracts stay clear for investigators
- Downstream persist/LLM paths receive cleaned text when gate engaged
- Copy stays assistive; IR drafting remains possible after a hit

## Escalation map

| Need | Worker |
|------|--------|
| Persist uses redacted text | Case Review |
| Investigate/LLM still sees raw | IR Drafting + Investigator LLM |
| Gate placement in stepper | Intake UX |
| PII in audit/support/admin | Identity Admin |

